@host = http://localhost:5056
# Get these from GET /sensors (step 1 below), then paste them here:
@sensorId = 0cc429e6-712a-40cc-a3ef-024f96714aac
@pumpId = PASTE-A-CONTROL-DEVICE-ID-HERE

### M1. Gateway - Mains Meter (cost 2)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "gateway", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:03", "cost": 2 }

### M2. Gateway - Greenhouse Temp (cost 4)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "gateway", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:01", "cost": 4 }

### M3. Greenhouse - Cold Room (cost 1)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:01", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:02", "cost": 1 }

### M4. Cold Room - Mains Meter (cost 5)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:02", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:03", "cost": 5 }

### M5. Mains Meter - Pump A (cost 2)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:03", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:04", "cost": 2 }

### M6. Pump A - Valve B (cost 3)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:04", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:05", "cost": 3 }

### M7. Greenhouse - Valve B (cost 6)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:01", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:05", "cost": 6 }

### M8. Cold Room - Pump A (cost 4)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:02", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:04", "cost": 4 }

### M9. View the whole mesh
GET {{host}}/mesh

### M10. Duplicate link (reversed order) - expect 400 "already linked"
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:03", "to": "gateway", "cost": 9 }

### M11. Link to itself - expect 400
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:01", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:01", "cost": 1 }

### M12. Unknown MAC - expect 400
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:01", "to": "FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF", "cost": 1 }

### M13. Bad cost - expect 400
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:02", "to": "gateway", "cost": 0 }

### M14. Remove a link (Greenhouse - Valve B)
DELETE {{host}}/mesh/links?from=AA:BB:CC:00:00:01&to=AA:BB:CC:00:00:05

### M15. Remove it again - expect 404
DELETE {{host}}/mesh/links?from=AA:BB:CC:00:00:01&to=AA:BB:CC:00:00:05


### M16. Put the Greenhouse - Valve B link back (cost 6)
POST {{host}}/mesh/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:01", "to": "AA:BB:CC:00:00:05", "cost": 6 }

### B1. Everything reachable from the gateway
GET {{host}}/mesh/reachable

### B2. Route for Cold Room
GET {{host}}/mesh/route/AA:BB:CC:00:00:02

### B3. Mark Mains Meter DOWN
POST {{host}}/mesh/nodes/AA:BB:CC:00:00:03/down

### B4. Reachable again (Mains is down)
GET {{host}}/mesh/reachable

### B5. Route for Pump A (must go around)
GET {{host}}/mesh/route/AA:BB:CC:00:00:04

### B6. Route for the down node itself
GET {{host}}/mesh/route/AA:BB:CC:00:00:03

### B7. Network status
GET {{host}}/mesh/status

### B8. Also mark Greenhouse DOWN (the gateway loses both of its links)
POST {{host}}/mesh/nodes/AA:BB:CC:00:00:01/down

### B9. Reachable now
GET {{host}}/mesh/reachable

### B10. Status (cut-off nodes)
GET {{host}}/mesh/status

### B11. Bring both back up
POST {{host}}/mesh/nodes/AA:BB:CC:00:00:03/up

###
POST {{host}}/mesh/nodes/AA:BB:CC:00:00:01/up

### B12. Reachable after recovery
GET {{host}}/mesh/reachable

### B13. Gateway cannot go down - expect 400
POST {{host}}/mesh/nodes/gateway/down

### B14. Unknown node - expect 400
GET {{host}}/mesh/route/FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF

### B15. Reachable from a different start node (Valve B)
GET {{host}}/mesh/reachable?from=AA:BB:CC:00:00:05

### P1. The minimum spanning tree
GET {{host}}/mesh/mst

### P2. Valve B: cheapest route vs fewest hops
GET {{host}}/mesh/mst/route/AA:BB:CC:00:00:05

### P3. Cold Room: cheapest route vs fewest hops
GET {{host}}/mesh/mst/route/AA:BB:CC:00:00:02

### P4. Pump A
GET {{host}}/mesh/mst/route/AA:BB:CC:00:00:04

### P5. Mark Mains Meter DOWN, then rebuild the tree
POST {{host}}/mesh/nodes/AA:BB:CC:00:00:03/down

### P6. Tree without Mains Meter
GET {{host}}/mesh/mst

### P7. Valve B route with Mains down
GET {{host}}/mesh/mst/route/AA:BB:CC:00:00:05

### P8. Route for the down node
GET {{host}}/mesh/mst/route/AA:BB:CC:00:00:03

### P9. Bring Mains Meter back up
POST {{host}}/mesh/nodes/AA:BB:CC:00:00:03/up

### P10. Unknown node - expect 400
GET {{host}}/mesh/mst/route/FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF


### Q1 - search a few terms
POST {{host}}/insights/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "term": "new11" }

### Q2 - another term
POST {{host}}/insights/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "term": "valve" }

### Q3 - see the queue (newest first)
GET {{host}}/insights/search-history